GAE

https://console.cloud.google.com/appengine/start?project=graphite-store-495909-j1&cloudshell=true
 

Step 1: Create Project Folder
In the terminal, type:
mkdir hello-app
cd hello-app
Check folder:
pwd

Step 2: Create main.py
Type:
nano main.py
Paste this code:
from flask import Flask

app = Flask(__name__)

@app.route('/')
def hello():
   return "Hello World from Google App Engine!"

if __name__ == '__main__':
   app.run(host='127.0.0.1', port=8080, debug=True)
Save file:
Press CTRL + O
Press Enter
Press CTRL + X

Step 3: Create requirements.txt
Type:
nano requirements.txt
Paste:
Flask==2.3.2
gunicorn==21.2.0
Save and exit.

Step 4: Create app.yaml
Type:
nano app.yaml
Paste:
runtime: python311

entrypoint: gunicorn -b :$PORT main:app
Save and exit.

Step 5: Install Packages
Run:
pip install -r requirements.txt
Wait until installation finishes.

Step 6: Run Application Locally
Run:
python main.py
You should see output like:
Running on http://127.0.0.1:8080

Step 7: Preview the App
In Cloud Shell:
Click Web Preview icon (top-right)
Select Preview on port 8080
You should see:
Hello World from Google App Engine!

Step 8: Initialize App Engine
Stop server using:
CTRL + C
Then run:
gcloud app create
If asked:
Choose region like:
asia-south1
Type the number and press Enter.

Step 9: Deploy Application
Run:
gcloud app deploy
When asked:
Do you want to continue (Y/n)?
Type:
Y
Deployment may take 2–5 minutes.

Step 10: Open the Live Website
Run:
gcloud app browse
Your deployed website will open in browser.
Example:
https://PROJECT-ID.appspot.com


Step 11: Verify Files
Run:
ls
You should see:
app.yaml
main.py
requirements.txt

Step 12: Simple Additional Web App
Replace code inside main.py with:
from flask import Flask

app = Flask(__name__)

@app.route('/')
def home():
   return "Welcome to My Web App"

@app.route('/about')
def about():
   return "This is About Page"

@app.route('/add/<int:a>/<int:b>')
def add(a, b):
   return str(a + b)

if __name__ == '__main__':
   app.run(debug=True)
Deploy again:
gcloud app deploy
Test URLs:
/about
/add/5/10
Outputs:
This is About Page
15


